From d1f1892dc041043467287af4b320eb1b42e7cb46 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: huppiflupp <144213886+huppiflupp@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 21 Sep 2026 16:07:28 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 2/5] lab: packed dense matmul with persistent packed weights
 (GGML_VK_LAB_MM_PACKED=1|2)

strix-halo-kernel-lab E020-E025: operands packed tile by tile, 4x4 output tiles per wave, weight-block-major
order, packed f16 copy of each weight matrix kept after first use, zero-padding to 64 rows/tokens.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
